<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shadow Of A Man (Apple Music Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lady Gaga"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="レディー・ガガ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Apple Music Live: MAYHEM Requiem"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM72603841"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6768201925"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Andrew Watt</songwriter><songwriter>Henry Russell Walter</songwriter><songwriter>Lady Gaga</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:27.869"><div begin="32.732" end="47.848" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="32.732" end="36.288" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.732" end="33.478">Standing</span> <span begin="33.478" end="33.681">in</span> <span begin="33.681" end="33.918">the</span> <span begin="33.918" end="34.558">shadow</span> <span begin="34.558" end="34.788">of</span> <span begin="34.788" end="35.385">another</span> <span begin="35.385" end="36.288">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笼罩在又一个男人的阴影之下</span></p><p begin="36.888" end="40.114" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.888" end="37.534">Lonely</span> <span begin="37.534" end="37.774">as</span> <span begin="37.774" end="37.974">the</span> <span begin="37.974" end="38.270">streets</span> <span begin="38.270" end="38.603">pass</span> <span begin="38.603" end="38.803">me</span> <span begin="38.803" end="40.114">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤独地看着街景与我擦肩而过</span></p><p begin="40.888" end="44.658" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.888" end="41.205">Life</span> <span begin="41.205" end="41.472">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="41.472" end="42.021">under</span> <span begin="42.021" end="42.528">pressure</span> <span begin="42.528" end="42.832">&apos;cause</span> <span begin="42.832" end="43.061">I</span> <span begin="43.061" end="43.368">got</span> <span begin="43.368" end="43.555">a</span> <span begin="43.555" end="44.658">plan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活还算轻松 因为我早有计划</span></p><p begin="45.032" end="47.848" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.032" end="45.685">Staring</span> <span begin="45.685" end="45.885">at</span> <span begin="45.885" end="46.405">myself</span> <span begin="46.405" end="46.632">in</span> <span begin="46.632" end="46.845">the</span> <span begin="46.845" end="47.848">eye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直视自己的眼睛</span></p></div><div begin="49.314" end="1:05.269" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="49.314" end="53.408" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.314" end="49.586">When</span> <span begin="49.586" end="49.760">I</span> <span begin="49.760" end="49.973">get</span> <span begin="49.973" end="50.200">this</span> <span begin="50.200" end="50.866">feeling,</span> <span begin="51.026" end="51.453">I</span> <span begin="51.453" end="51.893">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="51.893" end="52.429">get</span> <span begin="52.429" end="53.408">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我涌起这种感觉 心中便无法自拔</span></p><p begin="53.408" end="57.657" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.408" end="53.657">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="53.657" end="53.777">I</span> <span begin="53.777" end="54.003">start</span> <span begin="54.003" end="54.921">believing,</span> <span begin="55.150" end="55.510">and</span> <span begin="55.510" end="56.003">my</span> <span begin="56.003" end="56.523">voice</span> <span begin="56.523" end="56.750">gets</span> <span begin="56.750" end="57.657">tough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我开始坚信 语气也变得铿锵有力</span></p><p begin="57.657" end="1:00.413" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.657" end="57.828">Now</span> <span begin="57.828" end="57.964">I</span> <span begin="57.964" end="58.148">got</span> <span begin="58.148" end="58.361">this</span> <span begin="58.361" end="58.689">fee</span><span begin="58.689" end="1:00.413">ling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我涌起这种感觉</span></p><p begin="1:00.993" end="1:05.269" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.993" end="1:01.417">And</span> <span begin="1:01.417" end="1:01.697">I</span> <span begin="1:01.697" end="1:01.940">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:01.940" end="1:02.204">be</span> <span begin="1:02.204" end="1:02.457">used</span> <span begin="1:02.457" end="1:02.710">for</span> <span begin="1:02.710" end="1:02.940">my</span> <span begin="1:02.940" end="1:03.206">love</span> <span begin="1:03.206" end="1:03.486">and</span> <span begin="1:03.486" end="1:03.753">left</span> <span begin="1:03.753" end="1:03.993">out</span> <span begin="1:03.993" end="1:04.233">to</span> <span begin="1:04.233" end="1:05.269">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再为爱所用 孤身落寞哭泣</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.466" end="1:20.927" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:05.466" end="1:10.156" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.466" end="1:05.652">I</span> <span begin="1:05.652" end="1:05.820">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:05.820" end="1:06.021">wanna</span> <span begin="1:06.021" end="1:06.191">fade</span> <span begin="1:06.191" end="1:06.373">into</span> <span begin="1:06.373" end="1:06.533">the</span> <span begin="1:06.533" end="1:07.160">darkness</span> <span begin="1:07.160" end="1:08.228">tonight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今夜我不愿陷入黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:07.896" end="1:10.156"><span begin="1:07.896" end="1:08.571">(Show</span> <span begin="1:08.571" end="1:09.091">me</span> <span begin="1:09.091" end="1:09.320">the</span> <span begin="1:09.320" end="1:10.156">light)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我看到光明</span></span></p><p begin="1:09.541" end="1:14.258" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.541" end="1:09.738">I</span> <span begin="1:09.738" end="1:09.871">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:09.871" end="1:10.125">wanna</span> <span begin="1:10.125" end="1:10.271">be</span> <span begin="1:10.271" end="1:10.405">the</span> <span begin="1:10.405" end="1:10.565">one</span> <span begin="1:10.565" end="1:10.698">to</span> <span begin="1:10.698" end="1:10.978">fall</span> <span begin="1:10.978" end="1:11.245">on</span> <span begin="1:11.245" end="1:11.394">the</span> <span begin="1:11.394" end="1:12.597">knife</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿承受利刃的伤痛</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:12.085" end="1:14.258"><span begin="1:12.085" end="1:12.672">(To</span> <span begin="1:12.672" end="1:13.178">come</span> <span begin="1:13.178" end="1:14.258">alive)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为觉醒重生</span></span></p><p begin="1:13.506" end="1:15.620" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.506" end="1:13.738">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:13.738" end="1:13.964">about</span> <span begin="1:13.964" end="1:14.114">to</span> <span begin="1:14.114" end="1:14.351">be</span> <span begin="1:14.351" end="1:14.634">there,</span> <span begin="1:14.634" end="1:14.807">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:14.807" end="1:15.127">about</span> <span begin="1:15.127" end="1:15.260">to</span> <span begin="1:15.260" end="1:15.408">be</span> <span begin="1:15.408" end="1:15.620">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就快成功 我就快成功</span></p><p begin="1:15.620" end="1:20.927" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.620" end="1:15.900">Watch</span> <span begin="1:15.900" end="1:16.180">me,</span> <span begin="1:16.180" end="1:16.687">I</span> <span begin="1:16.687" end="1:17.154">swear</span> <span begin="1:17.154" end="1:17.660">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:17.660" end="1:17.980">dance</span> <span begin="1:17.980" end="1:18.194">in</span> <span begin="1:18.194" end="1:18.460">the</span> <span begin="1:18.460" end="1:19.034">shadow</span> <span begin="1:19.034" end="1:19.300">of</span> <span begin="1:19.300" end="1:19.490">a</span> <span begin="1:19.490" end="1:20.927">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着我 我发誓要在男人的阴影下起舞</span></p></div><div begin="1:21.658" end="1:37.874" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:21.658" end="1:25.205" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.658" end="1:21.996">Hard</span> <span begin="1:21.996" end="1:22.223">to</span> <span begin="1:22.223" end="1:22.503">be</span> <span begin="1:22.503" end="1:22.770">the</span> <span begin="1:22.770" end="1:23.343">yellow</span> <span begin="1:23.343" end="1:23.596">in</span> <span begin="1:23.596" end="1:23.823">a</span> <span begin="1:23.823" end="1:24.263">purple</span> <span begin="1:24.263" end="1:25.205">sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紫色天空中 难以成为那一抹金黄亮色</span></p><p begin="1:25.847" end="1:28.682" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.847" end="1:26.337">Peaking</span> <span begin="1:26.337" end="1:26.548">through</span> <span begin="1:26.548" end="1:26.804">the</span> <span begin="1:26.804" end="1:27.151">eye</span> <span begin="1:27.151" end="1:27.417">of</span> <span begin="1:27.417" end="1:27.604">the</span> <span begin="1:27.604" end="1:28.682">storm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">透过风暴之眼窥见一切</span></p><p begin="1:29.829" end="1:33.485" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.829" end="1:30.423">Gotta</span> <span begin="1:30.423" end="1:30.650">be</span> <span begin="1:30.650" end="1:30.903">the</span> <span begin="1:30.903" end="1:31.197">truth</span> <span begin="1:31.197" end="1:31.437">or</span> <span begin="1:31.437" end="1:31.690">you&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:31.690" end="1:32.223">become</span> <span begin="1:32.223" end="1:32.463">a</span> <span begin="1:32.463" end="1:33.485">lie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">势要成为真理 否则就会沦为谎言</span></p><p begin="1:33.858" end="1:37.874" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.858" end="1:34.397">Piercing</span> <span begin="1:34.397" end="1:34.637">like</span> <span begin="1:34.637" end="1:34.877">your</span> <span begin="1:34.877" end="1:35.223">skin</span> <span begin="1:35.223" end="1:35.519">from</span> <span begin="1:35.519" end="1:35.773">a</span> <span begin="1:35.773" end="1:37.874">thorn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如荆棘刺入你的肌肤</span></p></div><div begin="1:38.221" end="1:54.259" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:38.221" end="1:42.234" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.221" end="1:38.440">When</span> <span begin="1:38.440" end="1:38.560">I</span> <span begin="1:38.560" end="1:38.787">get</span> <span begin="1:38.787" end="1:39.013">this</span> <span begin="1:39.013" end="1:39.880">feeling,</span> <span begin="1:39.880" end="1:40.360">I</span> <span begin="1:40.360" end="1:40.853">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:40.853" end="1:41.413">get</span> <span begin="1:41.413" end="1:42.234">enough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我涌起这种感觉 心中便无法自拔</span></p><p begin="1:42.281" end="1:46.374" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.281" end="1:42.534">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:42.534" end="1:42.668">I</span> <span begin="1:42.668" end="1:42.854">start</span> <span begin="1:42.854" end="1:43.828">believing,</span> <span begin="1:43.828" end="1:44.281">and</span> <span begin="1:44.281" end="1:44.801">my</span> <span begin="1:44.801" end="1:45.361">voice</span> <span begin="1:45.361" end="1:45.614">gets</span> <span begin="1:45.614" end="1:46.374">tough</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我开始坚信 语气也变得铿锵有力</span></p><p begin